Usage: semaphore-cli config <command> [flags]

Validate and print the version 2 bootstrap file of the relay proxy

Flags:
  -h, --help             Show context-sensitive help.
  -v, --version          Print the version and exit

  -o, --output="text"    output format: text or json (YAML for print)

Commands:
  config validate <file> [flags]
    Check a bootstrap file with the loader of the relay proxy

  config print <file> [flags]
    Print the effective bootstrap file: defaults and environment overrides
    applied, secrets redacted
